001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.     TQTCOMPR.
001300 AUTHOR.         BARBARA WINTER.
001400*INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
001500*DATE-WRITTEN.   NOVEMBER 1987.
001600*REMARKS.
001700***************************************************************
001800*                    T Q T C O M P R                          *
001900*     THIS PROGRAM COMPARES UP TO 3 QUOTES AT A TIME.  IT     *
002000*  CAN GIVE A DETAILED REPORT OR A SUMMARY REPORT OF EACH     *
002100*  QUOTE CODED ITEM, ITS PRICE PER UNIT, THE BID QTY, AND THE *
002200*  EXTENDED DOLLAR AMOUNT PER CODE.  IT ALSO TOTALS UP THE    *
002300*  DOLLAR AMOUNT FOR EACH QUOTE.                              *
002400***************************************************************
      *                                                             *
      *  CHANGES:                                                   *
      *                                                             *
      *  10/20/99    CA YODER   NAPANEE REQUEST                     *
      *     ADDED KEYWORD/MODIFIER TO DETAIL REPORT.                *
      *                                                             *
      *  04/09/02    CA YODER   NAPANEE REQUEST                     *
      *     EXPANDED PRICE FIELDS FROM 2 TO 4 DECIMAL PLACES.       *
      *                                                             *
      ***************************************************************
002500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002600 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002700 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
002800 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.  C01 IS NEW-PAGE.
010600 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
010700 FILE-CONTROL.
010800       SELECT PRINT-FILE   ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
011000       SELECT SORT-FILE          ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
011100
             SELECT DVENDOR-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT DVENDITM-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0803
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DCODE-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3402
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

011200 DATA DIVISION.
011300 FILE SECTION.
       FD  DVENDOR-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DVENDOR-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0700  OF MCFLCS0701.

       FD  DVENDITM-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DVENDITM-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0800  OF MCFLCS0803.
